      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Introducing the <strong>QBZ-97 5.56x45 Assault Rifle</strong>, ported from <strong>Insurgency: Sandstorm.</strong></p>\n<p>The <strong>QBZ-97</strong> (short for <strong>Infantry Rifle Type 97</strong>) is a bullpup automatic rifle manufactured by China. It’s the <strong>5.56mm NATO export version</strong> of the QBZ-95, widely used by the Chinese military with its 5.8x42mm cartridge.</p>\n<p>This reliable, cost-effective, and fun-to-shoot rifle is popular among armed forces in Southeast Asia and firearm enthusiasts worldwide. Although banned in some regions, you can now wield it in Tarkov!</p>\n<p>- Model and sounds sourced from <strong>New World Interactive’s Insurgency: Sandstorm</strong>.</p>\n<p>- Animations are <strong>tweaked versions of ASH-12’s</strong> to accommodate the AR-style magwell.</p>\n<h3><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8436-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8436-pasted-from-clipboard-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8437-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8437-pasted-from-clipboard-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8438-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/8438-pasted-from-clipboard-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></h3></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Setup and Usage</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Unzip the downloaded files.</p>\n<p>2. Drop the mod folder in to the spt directory.</p>\n<p>3. Launch the game.</p>\n<p>4. Visit <strong>Mechanic’s shop</strong> or the <strong>Flea Market</strong> to find the rifle and its parts.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Permissions and Legal</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>When reuploading or sharing this mod</strong>, please clearly indicate the author or source.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Do not distribute files with the <code>.bundle</code> extension</strong> (or its variants) from this mod without permission.</p>\n<p>- Respect the original creator’s rights:</p>\n<p>- Models, textures, and sounds by <strong>New World Interactive [Insurgency: Sandstorm]</strong>.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>Original models and textures:</strong> Activision</p>\n<p>- <strong>Special thanks to:</strong> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/18902-massivesoft/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
